# calc: integer arithmetic in BeeShell; errors never crash the kernel.
$ calc 2 + 3
5
$ calc 2 * 3
6
$ calc 2+3*4
14
$ calc (2 + 3) * 4
20
$ calc -7 / 2
-3
$ calc 7 % 3
1
$ calc 1 / 0
calc: division by zero
$ calc 9223372036854775807 + 1
calc: overflow
$ calc 2 +
calc: parse error
$ calc abc
calc: parse error
$ calc
~ ^usage: calc EXPR
$ help
~ ^\s+calc EXPR\s+integer arithmetic
$ calc 1 + 1
2
